 1828/ B3A : 14 18 14                           ADC     ACC2_HI, LOOP1_CTR
 1829/ B3D :                            .vib2_sine_lookup:                                ; 1 refs
 1830/ B3D : D8 14                              LD      R13, ACC2_HI                    ; R13 = phase high byte (quadrant selector)
 1831/ B3F : 66 14 40                           TCM     ACC2_HI, #40h                   ; test quadrant bit 6
 1832/ B42 : EB 03                              JR      NZ, .vib2_no_negate             ; quadrant 2 or 4: negate R13 (COM+INC)
 1833/ B44 : 60 ED                              COM     R13
