 1865/ B81 :                            .vib2_exit:                                ; 2 refs
 1866/ B81 : 20 1B                              INC     PROG_CTR                        ; add saved ACC offset: R8:R9 += saved values
 1867/ B83 : 05 1B E9                           ADD     ACC_LO, @PROG_CTR
