 2387/ E9C :                            ; Set pitch from normalized multiply result (NOT the T byte!).
 2388/ E9C :                            ; R10 = high byte of ACC * PITCH_coeff / 2048, normalized to >= $1E.
 2389/ E9C :                            ; This IS the actual pitch: timer period = R10 * prescaler * 4 ext clocks.
