 2395/ EA6 :                            .synthesis_pass_done:
 2396/ EA6 :                            ; synthesis_pass_done: runs ONCE at end of initial RAUD setup.
 2397/ EA6 :                            ; OR IMR,#$02: enable IRQ1 (ECLK input on P3.3) — wait for COP's first ECLK.
 2398/ EA6 :                            ; When COP sends the next ECLK pulse, irq1_handler fires:
 2399/ EA6 :                            ;   loads T0 timer, starts T0, enables IRQ4, forces first IRQ4
 2400/ EA6 :                            ;   → micro-op dispatch begins → DAC output starts.
 2401/ EA6 :                            ; After this one-shot, FLAGS bit 0 is cleared → subsequent passes go
 2402/ EA6 :                            ; through micro_program_interpreter instead (normal synthesis loop).
