 2417/ EBE :                            irq1_handler:
 2418/ EBE :                            ; irq1_handler: triggered by ECLK (COP envelope clock, ~200Hz per voice).
 2419/ EBE :                            ; LD T0, TIMER_LOAD: load T0 counter with R6 (base pitch value).
 2420/ EBE :                            ; Starts timer T0 which generates IRQ4 at the sample rate.
