 2550/ F92 :                            ; normalize: floating-point normalization of multiply result.
 2551/ F92 :                            ; R12:R11 = mantissa (multiply result), R13 = exponent (sub mode).
 2552/ F92 :                            ; Shifts mantissa left (x2) and INC exponent until R12 >= $1E.
 2553/ F92 :                            ; Each sub INCrement selects a faster timer / simpler micro-op chain.
